{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41818","headline":"依韵和蠡泽王去微秀才见寄 · 李中","name":"依韵和蠡泽王去微秀才见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"咫尺风骚客，难谐面继酬。\n相思对烟雨，一鴈下汀洲。\n花影谁家坞，笛声何处楼？\n搘筇朗吟罢，搔首独迟留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41818.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41818","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}